# Joining real R5 galaxies at snapshot 32: the central's main progenitor joins its FoF halo (Type
# 0 -> 0, B:284-300) and its satellite loses its subhalo (Type 1 -> 2, clock set, B:322-338). The
# halo's Mvir equals the galaxy's, so B:267 is not taken and the call reads the written Vvir with
# the written Vmax (the halo's): the current pair (previous Type 0). The orphan keeps its written
# Concentration.
# End-of-snapshot output values used as plausible call inputs, not reconstructed call-time state.
# Source: R5 reference
